# The quality gates decide what "done" means for every change, agent-written ones included. A pull request that
# loosens them (a rule turned off, a threshold raised, a module dropped from COVERAGE_GATE, a selector dropped from
# .oxlintrc.json, a Lighthouse budget raised) needs a review from the owners below. A repository that copies these
# files replaces @TiagoGranelli with its own team or user, and requires code-owner review in the branch protection of
